//#sls.file.component.name
export component Widget inherits Window {}
/*
The generated struct carries the identifier that follows `component`:
```rust
//#sls.gen.component
let _ = Widget::new(crate::harness::WINDOW_SIZE);
```

The file name is not the component's name:
```rust compile_fail
let _ = Name::new(crate::harness::WINDOW_SIZE);
//~ ERROR use of undeclared type `Name`
```
*/
